   "widgets_values": [
    "## SDXL ControlNet (depth)\n\nKeeps the layout and shapes of the photo and redraws it from your prompt.\n\n- Union mode: `depth` (also try `canny/lineart...` or `openpose` with a matching preprocessor)\n- Strength 0.5-0.8; lower = freer, higher = closer to the photo\n- End percent 0.8 lets the last steps refine detail\n- Pony/Illustrious checkpoints work but follow the control less tightly"
